      "message": "docs: add desktop-shell contract; update status fields\n\nDocument the window-shell invariants (chrome geometry single source of\ntruth, hit-test map, single-owner control visibility, stay-on-top, render\npolicy) and replace window_pip/mini_pointer_inside with window_on_top in\nthe status contract.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
